inc/open_graph_images/?job_id=1577&lang=eng&change_id=14f92ddca937eade3f2558694f900ce6\" />\n<link rel=\"image_src\" href=\"https://jobs-pfandbriefbank.com/inc/open_graph_images/?job_id=1577&lang=eng&change_id=14f92ddca937eade3f2558694f900ce6\"/>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\n    \"@context\": \"http:\\/\\/schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"JobPosting\",\n    \"responsibilities\": \"<ul><li>You ...<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\n    \"qualifications\": \"<ul><li>You ...<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\n    \"jobBenefits\": \"<p>We live our values and expect the same attitude from our employees. Together, we are future-oriented, reliable, and collaborative.&nbsp;<\\/p><h2>What you can expect<\\/h2><p><br>With us, you will encounter a sustainable corporate culture, diverse and challenging projects, as well as plenty of creative freedom and flexibility.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>And what else?<\\/p><ul><li>Compelling compensation &amp; great benefits<\\/li><li>Family-friendly working conditions with at least two days remote working<\\/li><li>Attractive, easy-to-reach locations&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul><h2><strong>Sounds exciting?&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/h2><p>So let's shape the future of real estate together. Apply now to join #teampbb in just a few clicks!<\\/p>\",\n    \"description\": \"<h2><\\/h2><p>Deutsche Pfandbriefbank AG (pbb) is an international specialized commercial bank with over 800 employees from 37 countries. We offer our customers a wide range of financing and investment solutions for the entire real estate value chain. Our goal is to contribute to a more sustainable world of real estate.<\\/p><p>For our CIO\\/COO business area based in Madrid, we are currently seeking to hire, with immediate effect, an<\\/p><h1>IT Application Owner Atlassian Tools (m\\/f\\/d)<\\/h1><h2>Your tasks<\\/h2><ul><li>You support the operational and technical management of Jira and Confluence as well as bitbucket<\\/li><li>You develop new workflows, customizations and automations for Jira and Confluence Data Center and Cloud<\\/li><li>You are responsible for the application management of other standard applications<\\/li><li>You ensure stability, security, performance, maintenance and compliance with internal standards in coordination with the software provider and relevant stakeholders for the applications in your responsibility<\\/li><li>You manage incidents, vulnerabilities, changes, upgrades and releases in coordination with the software providers and relevant stakeholders<\\/li><li>You coordinate projects and participate actively in new initiatives regarding the applications you are responsible for<\\/li><li>You drive continuous improvement by identifying optimization opportunities and implementing sustainable solutions<\\/li><\\/ul><h2>How to convince us<\\/h2><ul><li>2 - 5 years of proven experience in Application Management, Application Support, or IT Operations, as well as IT Project Management, ideally in the financial services industry<\\/li><li>Experience with Jira, Confluence and Bitbucket Data Center and\\/or Cloud<\\/li><li>Experience with Jira\\/Confluence groovy scripting and Jira automation (Data Center and\\/or Cloud)<\\/li><li>Knowledge of databases (Oracle, MSSQL), SQL, Windows\\/Linux Server OS and role-based access control concepts<\\/li><li>Excellent communication, analytical and problem-solving skills, with fluent English and the ability to work independently in an international environment<\\/li><li>Willingness to travel within EU from time to time<\\/li><li>Knowledge of the German Language is an advantage<\\/li><\\/ul><h2>Our values<\\/h2><p>We live our values and expect the same attitude from our employees. Together, we are future-oriented, reliable, and collaborative.&nbsp;<\\/p><h2>What you can expect<\\/h2><p><br>With us, you will encounter a sustainable corporate culture, diverse and challenging projects, as well as plenty of creative freedom and flexibility.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>And what else?<\\/p><ul><li>Compelling compensation &amp; great benefits<\\/li><li>Family-friendly working conditions with at least two days remote working<\\/li><li>Attractive, easy-to-reach locations&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul><h2><strong>Sounds exciting?&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/h2><p>So let's shape the future of real estate together. Apply now to join #teampbb in just a few clicks!<\\/p>\",\n    \"datePosted\": \"2026-11-12\",\n    \"directApply\": true,\n    \"employmentType\": \"FULL_TIME\",\n    \"hiringOrganization\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Deutsche Pfandbriefbank AG\",\n        \"sameAs\": \"\",\n        \"logo\": \"\"\n    },\n    \"jobLocation\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Place\",\n        \"address\": {\n            \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n            \"streetAddress\": \"Calle Rosario Pino, 14 \\u2013 16, 7\\u00aa Planta\",\n            \"addressLocality\": \"Madrid\",\n            \"addressRegion\": \"Madrid\",\n            \"postalCode\": \"28020\",\n            \"addressCountry\": \"ES\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"title\": \"IT Application Owner Atlassian Tools (m\\/f\\/d)\",\n    \"validThrough\": \"2027-05-01\"\n}</script>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://jobs-pfandbriefbank.com/IT-Application-Owner-Atlassian-Tools-mfd-eng-j1577.html\" />\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"https://jobs-pfandbriefbank.com/tpl/bilder/deutschepfandbri/symbole/pbb_Favicon_pos_rgb.svg?ver=1788353691\">\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\" href=\"https://jobs-pfandbriefbank.com/tpl/templates/deutschepfandbri/styles/main.css?ver=1788353691\">\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\" href=\"https://jobs-pfandbriefbank.com/tpl/templates/deutschepfandbri/styles/font-awesome.css?ver=1788353691\">\n\n<script src=\"https://jobs-pfandbriefbank.com/js/jquery-3.7.1.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://jobs-pfandbriefbank.com/js/jquery-ui/jquery-ui-1.14.2/jquery-ui.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://jobs-pfandbriefbank.com/js/common.js?v=14\"